#: src/migrate/webstorm.md:241
msgid "Debug Panel"
msgstr "除錯面板"

#: src/migrate/webstorm.md:241
msgid "`Cmd + 5`"
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/webstorm.md:243
msgid ""
"Zed has three dock positions: left, bottom, and right. Panels can be moved "
"between docks by dragging or through settings."
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/webstorm.md:245
msgid ""
"Note that there's no dedicated npm tool window in Zed. Use the terminal or "
"define tasks for your common npm scripts."
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/webstorm.md:247
msgid "Debugging"
msgstr "除錯"

#: src/migrate/webstorm.md:249
